# Compiled target projects (reproducible via `unmute compile`; goldens are the tracked form)
examples/*/build/

# Release artifacts: GoReleaser writes every build, archive, checksum and SBOM here
dist/

# Legacy single-file working spec. Feature specs now live in specs/<nnn>-<slug>/
# (GitHub Spec Kit) and are committed there.
/SPEC.md

# The maintainer's release runbook: a local working note, deliberately not
# committed. The facts it depends on stay in the repo either way, in
# .goreleaser.yaml, .github/workflows/release.yml and
# specs/010-goreleaser-release-pipeline/. Nothing tracked may link to it.
/RELEASING.md

__pycache__/
.codex/worktrees/
.firecrawl
bin/

